Many are already using Printify to&nbsp;
earn five, or even six figures a month.&nbsp;

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:22.720
But even if you don't, it's still a great&nbsp;
way to give you another revenue stream,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:25.840
and build some passive income.
